final class TaxPolicy {
    BigDecimal calculate(Order order) {
        return order.subtotal().multiply(new BigDecimal("0.18"));
    }
}

@Test
void calculatesTaxFromSubtotal() {
    var policy = new TaxPolicy();
    var order = new Order(new BigDecimal("100.00"));

    assertEquals(new BigDecimal("18.0000"), policy.calculate(order));
}
```

The rule can be tested without an HTTP request, database, or mail client. Separate integration tests can verify those boundaries where they actually exist.

